translate schinese chapter_five_scene_twenty_thirty_one_C_98a0601d:

    # mc "What the chancellor is doing is one of the toughest, but most efficient ways for a ruler to come into power."
    mc "宰相所做的，是统治者掌权最困难却也最高效的手段之一。"

