translate schinese chapter_five_scene_twenty_thirty_one_C_8908963e:

    # mc "I sincerely doubt he can cast a spell powerful enough to control everyone in Temporia…"
    mc "我真怀疑他有没有强大到能控制整个坦皮奥拉的法术……"

# game/chapters/chapter_five/chapter_five.rpy:1931
translate schinese chapter_five_scene_twenty_thirty_one_C_6bd1bb93:

    # wi "So he just did this to show the people that their lives can be better with him in charge?"
    wi "所以他这么做，只是为了让民众看看由他掌权能过得更好？"

