translate schinese chapter_five_scene_twenty_thirty_one_C_f8451237:

    # wi "Temporia does also look cleaner than ever before…"
    wi "坦皮奥拉看起来也确实比以往任何时候都更整洁……"

# game/chapters/chapter_five/chapter_five.rpy:1943
translate schinese chapter_five_scene_twenty_thirty_one_C_cc9373cb:

    # mc "It’s his way of showing people he can do better with the kingdom than Ravena could."
    mc "这是他的方式，向民众展示他治理王国比拉维娜做得更好。"

